The Den API conformance suite, as Den carries it

This folder is a byte-identical copy of the conformance suite for
den-api.sock (docs/DREY-API.md), written by Drey's authors, who check their
client against the same suite. Den changes nothing in it: a finding is fixed
upstream and the copy pinned again.

